S1 Entry/readiness: loading -> compiling -> ready from both blueprint and exploded narrative modes (buttons /BLUEPRINT WIREFRAME/ and /EXPLODED ASSEMBLY/); Play disabled before ready; the core bundle requested once per session (full tier: manufacturing-core-full.glb); zero console/page errors (record warnings separately; THREE.Clock deprecation and D3D shader precision X4122 warnings are known).
